            "components": [
              {
                "kind": "form",
                "id": "what-if-form",
                "title": "Evaluate a sign-in",
                "description": "Simulate which enabled or report-only policies apply to a specific sign-in.",
                "fields": [
                  { "id": "user", "label": "User, agent identity, or service principal", "control": "select", "required": true, "defaultValue": "mira.ileri@contoso.example", "options": [{ "value": "mira.ileri@contoso.example", "label": "Mira Ileri" }, { "value": "breakglass1@contoso.example", "label": "Breakglass 1" }, { "value": "alex@contoso.example", "label": "Alex Wilber" }] },
                  { "id": "targetResource", "label": "Target resource", "control": "select", "required": true, "defaultValue": "All resources", "options": [{ "value": "All resources", "label": "All resources" }, { "value": "Office 365", "label": "Office 365" }, { "value": "Microsoft Admin Portals", "label": "Microsoft Admin Portals" }] },
                  { "id": "devicePlatform", "label": "Device platform", "control": "select", "required": true, "defaultValue": "Windows", "options": [{ "value": "Windows", "label": "Windows" }, { "value": "iOS", "label": "iOS" }, { "value": "Android", "label": "Android" }] },
                  { "id": "clientApp", "label": "Client app", "control": "select", "required": true, "defaultValue": "Browser", "options": [{ "value": "Browser", "label": "Browser" }, { "value": "Mobile apps and desktop clients", "label": "Mobile apps and desktop clients" }] }
                ],
                "submit": {
                  "label": "What If",
                  "actions": [
                    { "type": "append", "path": "whatIfRuns", "value": { "user": "{{$form.user}}", "targetResource": "{{$form.targetResource}}", "devicePlatform": "{{$form.devicePlatform}}", "clientApp": "{{$form.clientApp}}", "result": "CA-Finance-Require-MFA applies in report-only mode; grant control requires Multifactor authentication strength.", "createdAt": "{{$now}}" } },
                    { "type": "message", "tone": "success", "text": "What If evaluation complete. Matching report-only policies are listed below." }
                  ]
                }
              },
              { "kind": "table", "id": "what-if-results", "title": "Evaluation results", "source": "whatIfRuns", "rowKey": "createdAt", "emptyText": "No What If evaluations yet.", "columns": [{ "key": "user", "label": "User" }, { "key": "targetResource", "label": "Target resource" }, { "key": "result", "label": "Policies that apply" }] }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "initialState": {
          "groups": [
            { "name": "All finance users", "membershipType": "Dynamic User", "members": ["mira.ileri@contoso.example", "adele@contoso.example", "lana@contoso.example"], "description": "Dynamic group where user.department equals Finance." },
            { "name": "Emergency Access Accounts", "membershipType": "Assigned", "members": ["breakglass1@contoso.example", "breakglass2@contoso.example"], "description": "Break-glass accounts monitored and stored securely." },
            { "name": "All employees", "membershipType": "Dynamic User", "members": ["alex@contoso.example", "adele@contoso.example", "diego@contoso.example", "joni@contoso.example", "mira.ileri@contoso.example"], "description": "All enabled employee identities." },
            { "name": "Security team", "membershipType": "Assigned", "members": ["alex@contoso.example", "sara@contoso.example"], "description": "Security administrators and policy reviewers." }
          ],
          "conditionalAccessPolicies": [
            { "name": "CA-Block-Legacy-Authentication", "include": "All users", "exclude": "Emergency Access Accounts", "excludeEmergency": true, "targetResources": "All resources", "grant": "Block access", "grantDecision": "Block access", "state": "On" }
          ],
          "whatIfRuns": []
        }
      },
      "steps": [
        {
          "key": "review-groups",
          "title": "Review assignment groups",
          "instruction": "Open **Groups** and confirm that **All finance users** and **Emergency Access Accounts** exist before creating the policy.",
          "hint": "The policy will include the finance group and exclude emergency access accounts.",
          "explanation": "Conditional Access assignments should be deliberate. Emergency access accounts are excluded from restrictive policies so administrators can recover the tenant during an outage or misconfiguration.",
          "targetId": "ca-groups-table",
          "rules": [{ "key": "visited-groups", "description": "The groups page was reviewed", "rule": { "type": "visited", "page": "groups" } }]
        },
        {
          "key": "open-new-policy",
          "title": "Start a new Conditional Access policy",
          "instruction": "Go to **Conditional Access**, select **+ New policy**, and name the policy **CA-Finance-Require-MFA**.",
          "hint": "Conditional Access is under the Protection section in the simulated navigation.",
          "explanation": "A clear naming pattern helps administrators understand the assignment, target, and control before opening a policy.",
          "targetId": "ca-new-policy",
          "rules": [{ "key": "policy-created-by-end", "description": "The policy exists", "rule": { "type": "arrayContains", "path": "conditionalAccessPolicies", "match": { "name": "CA-Finance-Require-MFA" } }, "failureFeedback": "Create the policy named CA-Finance-Require-MFA." }]
        },
        {
          "key": "assignments",
          "title": "Configure users and target resources",
          "instruction": "In **Users**, include **All finance users** and exclude **Emergency Access Accounts**. In **Target resources**, choose **All resources (formerly 'All cloud apps')**.",
          "hint": "Missing the emergency access exclusion is one of the most dangerous Conditional Access mistakes.",
          "explanation": "Assignments define the scope of the policy: who is evaluated and what resources the sign-in targets.",
          "targetId": "ca-policy-wizard",
          "rules": [
            { "key": "assignments-correct", "description": "Finance users are included and break-glass accounts are excluded", "rule": { "type": "arrayContains", "path": "conditionalAccessPolicies", "match": { "name": "CA-Finance-Require-MFA", "include": "All finance users", "exclude": "Emergency Access Accounts", "excludeEmergency": true, "targetResources": "All resources" } }, "failureFeedback": "Include All finance users, exclude Emergency Access Accounts, and target All resources." }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "grant-report-only",
          "title": "Require MFA and test first",
          "instruction": "In **Grant**, choose **Grant access** and **Require authentication strength: Multifactor authentication**. Set **Enable policy** to **Report-only**, then select **Create**.",
          "hint": "Report-only evaluates policy impact without enforcing it. Turn it **On** only after reviewing results.",
          "explanation": "The policy decision is to grant access only when the MFA requirement is satisfied. Report-only mode lets the team validate impact first.",
          "targetId": "ca-policy-wizard",
          "rules": [
            { "key": "mfa-report-only", "description": "The policy requires MFA in report-only mode", "rule": { "type": "arrayContains", "path": "conditionalAccessPolicies", "match": { "name": "CA-Finance-Require-MFA", "grantDecision": "Grant access", "grant": "Require authentication strength: Multifactor authentication", "state": "Report-only" } }, "failureFeedback": "Require MFA and leave the policy in Report-only mode." }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "run-what-if",
          "title": "Test the policy with What If",
          "instruction": "Open **What If**, evaluate **Mira Ileri** accessing **All resources** from **Windows** with **Browser**, and review the result.",
          "hint": "The What If tool evaluates enabled and report-only policies for a simulated sign-in.",
          "explanation": "What If helps troubleshoot which policies would apply before asking a real user to sign in.",
          "targetId": "ca-what-if",
          "rules": [
            { "key": "what-if-run", "description": "A What If evaluation was run for Mira", "rule": { "type": "arrayContains", "path": "whatIfRuns", "match": { "user": "mira.ileri@contoso.example", "targetResource": "All resources" } }, "failureFeedback": "Run What If for Mira and All resources." }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "finalRules": [
        { "key": "break-glass-excluded", "description": "Emergency access accounts are excluded", "rule": { "type": "arrayContains", "path": "conditionalAccessPolicies", "match": { "name": "CA-Finance-Require-MFA", "excludeEmergency": true, "exclude": "Emergency Access Accounts" } }, "successFeedback": "Emergency access accounts are excluded from the report-only MFA policy.", "failureFeedback": "Exclude Emergency Access Accounts to avoid lockout." },
        { "key": "policy-report-only", "description": "The policy is not enforced yet", "rule": { "type": "arrayContains", "path": "conditionalAccessPolicies", "match": { "name": "CA-Finance-Require-MFA", "state": "Report-only" } }, "successFeedback": "The policy is safely staged for testing.", "failureFeedback": "Set Enable policy to Report-only until impact has been reviewed." },
        { "key": "mfa-grant", "description": "The grant control requires MFA", "rule": { "type": "arrayContains", "path": "conditionalAccessPolicies", "match": { "name": "CA-Finance-Require-MFA", "grant": "Require authentication strength: Multifactor authentication" } }, "successFeedback": "The grant control requires multifactor authentication.", "failureFeedback": "Require Multifactor authentication strength for the policy." }
      ],
      "solution": "1. Select **Groups** and confirm **All finance users** and **Emergency Access Accounts** exist.\n2. Select **Conditional Access** > **+ New policy**. Name it `CA-Finance-Require-MFA`.\n3. Under **Users**, include **Select users and groups > All finance users**. Turn on **Exclude Emergency Access Accounts** and choose **Emergency Access Accounts**.\n4. Under **Target resources**, select **All resources (formerly 'All cloud apps')**. Leave optional **Conditions** as **Any device** and **Any location**.\n5. Under **Grant**, choose **Grant access** and **Require authentication strength: Multifactor authentication**.\n6. Set **Enable policy** to **Report-only** and select **Create**.\n7. Select **What If**, evaluate **Mira Ileri** for **All resources**, **Windows**, and **Browser**, then review the report-only result."
    }
  ]
}
